<title>USA: Venture completes store sale to Kmart.</title>
<headline>Venture completes store sale to Kmart.</headline>
<dateline>O'FALLON, Mo. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venture Stores Inc said Friday it has closed on its agreement 20 stores to Kmart Corp for $38 million.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be invested by Venture to support its repositioning as a family value retailer in its historically profitable, core markets, Venture said.</p>
<p>Venture will secure additional capital through a merchandise liquidation sale, beginning Saturday at all 20 store locations being sold, the company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
